        {
            "title": "廣汽籌劃發A股購一汽整車公司部分權益 A股續停牌 H股今復牌",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">廣汽集團(02238)公布，正籌劃重大資產重組，涉及發A股購買一汽持有的某整車合資公司部分股權，並會募集配套資金。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"廣汽集團官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/12/02238-Web.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"廣汽集團官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/12/02238-Web.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">廣汽集團官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">該公司表示，為促進地方國企與央企產業資源優化整合，提升公司經營效益，已於9月14日(周一)與一汽簽署意向協議，擬發A股向一汽收購資產。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">經初步測算，在交易完成後，一汽將成為廣汽第2大和具有戰略影響力的股東；交易不構成廣汽實際控制中變更，不構成重組上市。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">現時上述交易尚處籌劃階段，存在不確定性，但為保證公平信息披露，避免股價異常波動，廣汽A股(0601238.SH)自9月14日開市起停牌，預計停牌時間不超過10個A股交易日；廣汽H股則於今早復牌。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16766838-%e5%bb%a3%e6%b1%bd%e7%b1%8c%e5%8a%83%e7%99%bca%e8%82%a1%e8%b3%bc%e4%b8%80%e6%b1%bd%e6%95%b4%e8%bb%8a%e5%85%ac%e5%8f%b8%e9%83%a8%e5%88%86%e6%ac%8a%e7%9b%8a-a%e8%82%a1%e7%ba%8c%e5%81%9c%e7%89%8c-h",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/12/20241202_FI_source-web_02238-2.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 08:37:33",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "黑期高水逾50點 重磅港股ADR幾全高收",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">新加坡黑期於今早約8時19分升96點或0.38%，報24,972點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股ADR指數報24,949點，較香港上日現貨收市高31點或0.13%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">騰訊(00700)ADR收市折合每股港幣432.9元，較上日香港收市高2.33元或0.54%；阿里巴巴(09988)ADR收市折合每股港幣107.1元，較上日香港收市高1.19元或1.12%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美團(03690)ADR收市折合每股港幣75.3元，較上日香港收市高0.24元或0.32%；京東(09618)ADR收市折合每股港幣106.9元，較上日香港收市高0.9元或0.85%；小米(01810)ADR收市折合每股港幣27.3元，較上日香港收市高0.1元或0.38%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：騰訊官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/bplib_20230703-101229__source-web_00700.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：騰訊官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/bplib_20230703-101229__source-web_00700.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：騰訊官網</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滙控(00005)ADR收市折合每股港幣163元，較上日香港收市低1.86元或1.13%；友邦(01299)ADR收市折合每股港幣75.5元，較上日香港收市高0.1元或0.13%；港交所(00388)ADR收市折合每股港幣397.6元，較上日香港收市高0.16元或0.04%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：滙控官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20230829_FI_source-web_HSBC-sign-Paris.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：滙控官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20230829_FI_source-web_HSBC-sign-Paris.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：滙控官網</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">中國平安(02318)ADR收市折合每股港幣54.2元，較上日香港收市高0.6元或1.11%；建設銀行(00939)ADR收市折合每股港幣9.9元，較上日香港收市高0.04元或0.35%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒指期貨夜市收報25,028點，升155點，較上日恒指收市24,917點，高水110點。科指期貨夜市收報4,362點，較上日科指收市高水44點；國指期貨夜市收報8,334點，較上日國指收市高水49點。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16766829-%e9%bb%91%e6%9c%9f%e9%ab%98%e6%b0%b4%e9%80%be50%e9%bb%9e-%e9%87%8d%e7%a3%85%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1adr%e5%b9%be%e5%85%a8%e9%ab%98%e6%94%b6",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/02/ADR-1_source-bp_-2-1.png.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 08:23:14",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
