            "title": "美元指數創約兩星期新高",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美元指數表現強勁，盤中一度攀升至99.735，漲幅超過0.6%，刷新約兩星期的最高水平，尾市則在99.47附近徘徊。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">非美貨幣方面，歐元兌美元於1.155水平附近徘徊；英鎊兌美元則在1.35水平陷入爭持；美元兌日圓報154.33。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">至於商品貨幣表現相對穩健，澳元兌美元貼近0.714，新西蘭元兌美元則報0.578左右。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16766593-%e7%be%8e%e5%85%83%e6%8c%87%e6%95%b8%e5%89%b5%e7%b4%84%e5%85%a9%e6%98%9f%e6%9c%9f%e6%96%b0%e9%ab%98",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/12/20240410_source-licensed_USD_FB.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 08:17:17",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
